---
// DG-PRE-57 (round 7): confirmation after the Stage 1: The Reset application (Jotform 263281893856068).
// Copy: Applications — confirmations tab, "Website confirmation / Stage 1". Layout: ThankYouPage (noindex; the sitemap
// filter already leaves out every *thankyou route). An application, not a booking: no calendar or booking language.
// The two articles are Tec's placeholders until Grova/Inka choose programme-relevant ones (tab).
// Jotform's whole-window redirect to this page is set up by the owner once the page is live; no data is passed in the URL.
import ThankYouPage from "../components/ThankYouPage.astro";
import AdvisorResources from "../components/AdvisorResources.astro";
---

<ThankYouPage
  title="Thank you for your application."
  heading="Stage 1: The Reset™"
  seoTitle="Application received: Stage 1 | DoGood Agency"
  description="Your Stage 1: The Reset application has been received. What happens next."
  canonical="https://www.dogoodagency.co/apply-stage-1-thankyou"
>
  <p>Taking the time to reflect on where you are and what comes next is a meaningful first step.</p>
  <p>Your application has been received. We will personally review what you have shared and get back to you within 24 hours.</p>
  <p><strong>What happens next?</strong></p>
  <p>
    If we see a potential fit, we will invite you to a private FRP-Fit Call. Together, we will explore your current
    situation, what you want to change and whether The Reset is the right next step for you.
  </p>
  <p>There is nothing further you need to do right now.</p>
  <p>In the meantime, you are welcome to explore more of our work.</p>
  <div class="bk-btn-row">
    <a class="btn-teal" href="/pathway">Explore the Pathway</a>
    <a class="btn-teal" href="/insights">Read our Insights</a>
  </div>
  <AdvisorResources
    slot="extra"
    articles={["first-90-days-after-the-sale", "emotions-of-selling-a-business"]}
    heading={null}
    links={false}
  />
</ThankYouPage>
